# Used by BuildKit for `-f addon/super_mail/Dockerfile` (it looks for <Dockerfile>.dockerignore).
# For the Home Assistant add-on, deploy/deploy.sh places the same file as .dockerignore at the add-on root.
**/.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.data
**/.superpowers
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/.env*
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.tsbuild
**/client_secret*.json
**/*.pem
**/deploy/deploy.env
